msgctxt "108"
msgid "I'm back, Uncle Kaz! Hope I didn't keep you waiting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Not at all. You get everything you need?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Yup! That should be enough to last us for like, three days!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "...Where's the food?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Oh, I bought so much they said they'll bring it over for me!\r\n"
"Perks of being a regular, hehe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Huh. I didn't even know they offered that kind of service."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"I don't think they do normally! But I get all our food over\r\n"
"here, and we need so much to feed all the kids, so they make an exception "
"for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Anyway, you should probably start heading to the airport,\r\n"
"Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Right. Want me to walk you back to the monorail before I go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Yes please!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"I have a lot of stuff to get so you can wait here, Uncle\r\n"
"Kaz. Or maybe go upstairs? I think there are supposed to\r\n"
"be some good restaurants up there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Sure, I'll take a look."
msgstr ""

